{
    "title": "Anagram Yatzy - Word Game",
    "description": "Elevate your brainpower with Anagram Yatzy! Just 10 minutes a day can enhance your mental agility!\r\n\r\nAnagram Yatzy is a thrilling mix of word puzzles and Yatzy-style gameplay. Connect letters, form words, and reach for high scores. Compete against friends or other players in a race to see who can score the most points by creatively forming words from a given set of letters.\r\n\r\nAnagram Yatzy offers:\r\n- High Score Events: Climb the leaderboards in a race for the highest score.\r\n- Duels Journey: Go head-to-head against competitors in progressive challenges.\r\n- Tiles Collection: Build up your collection and express yourself using unique Tile Styles.\r\n- Leagues Competition: Compete in weekly leagues to see who has truly mastered crafting words.\r\n\r\nIn Anagram Yatzy, strategy meets vocabulary:\r\n- Begin each game with 7 letters. Score big by strategically forming words.\r\n- Swap your letters for new ones, pushing for high-value words.\r\n- Enjoy the freedom of no time limits, allowing for thoughtful play.\r\n\r\nWhether competing in quick 2-round games or climbing the ranks in league competitions, Anagram Yatzy provides endless entertainment and brain training.\r\n\r\nCrafted by FunCraft, Anagram Yatzy is your daily brain workout, designed to test and improve your word skills. Join our community, accept the challenges, and sharpen your mind with us!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.funcraft.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nTerms of Service:\r\nhttps://www.funcraft.com/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "Elevate your brainpower with Anagram Yatzy! Just 10 minutes a day can enhance your mental agility!<br><br>Anagram Yatzy is a thrilling mix of word puzzles and Yatzy-style gameplay. Connect letters, form words, and reach for high scores. Compete against friends or other players in a race to see who can score the most points by creatively forming words from a given set of letters.<br><br>Anagram Yatzy offers:<br>- High Score Events: Climb the leaderboards in a race for the highest score.<br>- Duels Journey: Go head-to-head against competitors in progressive challenges.<br>- Tiles Collection: Build up your collection and express yourself using unique Tile Styles.<br>- Leagues Competition: Compete in weekly leagues to see who has truly mastered crafting words.<br><br>In Anagram Yatzy, strategy meets vocabulary:<br>- Begin each game with 7 letters. Score big by strategically forming words.<br>- Swap your letters for new ones, pushing for high-value words.<br>- Enjoy the freedom of no time limits, allowing for thoughtful play.<br><br>Whether competing in quick 2-round games or climbing the ranks in league competitions, Anagram Yatzy provides endless entertainment and brain training.<br><br>Crafted by FunCraft, Anagram Yatzy is your daily brain workout, designed to test and improve your word skills. Join our community, accept the challenges, and sharpen your mind with us!<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://www.funcraft.com/privacy-policy<br><br>Terms of Service:<br>https://www.funcraft.com/terms-of-use",
